# TRACE backend — top-level dependency SPEC (Phase 1, local).
#
# This is the human-authored input. `pip-compile` turns it into the
# fully-pinned, hash-verified LOCKFILE at requirements.txt — the file the
# Docker image and the dev venv actually install from — so every future build
# installs byte-for-byte the same packages as the verified demo image.
#
# Regenerate the lock after editing this file:
#   pip install pip-tools
#   pip-compile requirements.in --generate-hashes -o requirements.txt
#   # commit BOTH files together
#
# Versions are pinned == to the exact set installed in the verified demo
# image (Python 3.14.6, built 2026-08-13) — see Review.md §Module 8.

